%% TECH-009 Settled boxes in the feature tests
%% How the feature tests read a box now: the same helper as the design tests.
flowchart TD
    A[Feature test needs the size or position of an element] --> D[settledBox]
    D --> E{Compared with another box?}
    E -- yes --> F[Read both in one go with Promise.all]
    E -- no --> G[Compare with the limit]
    F --> G
